 "about_text": "Art Angels is a female-owned contemporary art gallery with its flagship space in the Beverly Hills Design District of Los Angeles, at 318 S Robertson Blvd. It is owned and operated by Jacquelin Napal and Kat Emery. The gallery represents a broad roster of contemporary artists working across photography, painting, sculpture and street-influenced practices, with a stated emphasis on supporting women and emerging talent alongside established international names. Beyond its main gallery, Art Angels maintains display partnerships in hotel and retail settings in Los Angeles, Miami and New York, and operates a design consultancy assisting developers and design firms. The gallery has also explored NFT drops with several of its artists.",
